  "legalAboutNagarik": "About NAGARIK",
  "legalAboutHeading": "NAGARIK — A Civic Good Initiative",
  "legalAboutBody": "NAGARIK gives citizens a simple way to report civic issues — potholes, broken streetlights, sanitation problems, water and electricity faults, safety hazards, and more — and to track each report from Submitted through In Review to Resolved.",
  "legalAboutHowHeading": "How it works",
  "legalAboutHowBody": "Report an issue with a description, category, location, and photos. Browse and search reports from your city or nearby. Follow the status of your own reports from your Profile.",
  "legalVersionHeading": "Version",
  "legalVersionBody": "NAGARIK 0.1.0",
  "legalPrivacyIntro": "This is placeholder text describing how NAGARIK handles your information. Replace it with your reviewed privacy policy before a real release.",
  "legalPrivacyCollectHeading": "What we collect",
  "legalPrivacyCollectBody": "Your name and email address (when you create an account), and the reports you submit — a category, description, city and PIN code, optional photos, and location coordinates when you choose to attach one.",
  "legalPrivacyUseHeading": "How we use it",
  "legalPrivacyUseBody": "To show your submitted reports back to you, to let other citizens browse and search civic issues in their area, and to track the status of a report as it moves from Submitted to In Review to Resolved.",
  "legalPrivacyStoredHeading": "Where it is stored",
  "legalPrivacyStoredBody": "Account and report data is stored with Supabase; photos are stored in a private file bucket and are never publicly browsable by their raw address.",
  "legalPrivacySharingHeading": "Sharing",
  "legalPrivacySharingBody": "We do not sell your personal information to third parties.",
  "legalContactHeading": "Contact",
  "legalPrivacyContactBody": "Questions about this policy can be sent to privacy@nagarik.example.",
  "legalTermsIntro": "This is placeholder text. Replace it with your reviewed terms of use before a real release.",
  "legalTermsUsingHeading": "Using NAGARIK",
  "legalTermsUsingBody": "NAGARIK is a civic issue reporting app. Reports you submit should be accurate and made in good faith — NAGARIK is not the right place for spam, harassment, or reports about private individuals rather than civic infrastructure or services.",
  "legalTermsAccountHeading": "Your account",
  "legalTermsAccountBody": "You are responsible for the reports submitted under your account. We may suspend or remove an account that misuses the app.",
  "legalTermsNoGuaranteeHeading": "No guaranteed resolution",
  "legalTermsNoGuaranteeBody": "Submitting a report shares it with other citizens and (where applicable) the relevant authority, but NAGARIK does not guarantee any particular resolution time or outcome for a reported issue.",
  "legalTermsChangesHeading": "Changes",
  "legalTermsChangesBody": "These terms may be updated from time to time; continuing to use the app after a change means you accept the updated terms.",
